## Expose server-computed version card capabilities

Context: Domain and Registry version cards need authoritative action metadata
from the server. Listings now expose role-aware lifecycle transitions and safe
deletion capabilities without mutating cached registry objects, while unreadable
versions remain visible with unsafe actions blocked.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/domain/Domain.py
   Added card metadata, transition capabilities, deletion capabilities, and fail-safe unreadable-version rows.
2. src/back/objects/domain/SettingsService.py
   Decorated a deep copy of cached Registry versions with role-aware deletion capabilities.
3. src/api/routers/internal/domain.py
   Forwarded request application and domain roles to the Domain version listing.
4. src/api/routers/internal/settings.py
   Forwarded the request application role to the Registry domain listing.
5. tests/units/domain/test_version_capabilities.py
   Added coverage for metadata, transitions, deletion guards, unreadable rows, and cache immutability.

